# Extended-features + IW runtime cost (4 permutations)

Image: 1024×1024 (1048576 pixels), iters per config: 100
Synthetic deterministic gradient + perturbation

| Config | n_features | min ms | median ms | mean ms | × vs standard |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| Standard      (228 features) | 228 | 11.11 | 12.27 | 12.41 | 1.00× |
| Extended only (300 features = +masked) | 300 | 12.19 | 13.50 | 13.78 | 1.11× |
| IW only       (300 features = +IW) | 300 | 12.76 | 13.78 | 14.10 | 1.14× |
| Extended + IW (372 features = +masked +IW) | 372 | 12.87 | 13.81 | 14.09 | 1.13× |

_All times are wall-clock per `compute_zensim_with_config` call, single (ref, dist) pair, parallel=true (rayon)._
